  <metadata>
    <title>Item 3 (D-12) — rename `TenancyModel.Model1Shared` → `Model1` + `Model2Dedicated` → `Model2`; update `sprk_tenancymodel` Dataverse option-set labels; retire T223 H12c-string preservation invariant (greenfield: no completed phases to preserve)</title>
    <phase>D-12/D-13 remediation — INCOMING-D12-D13-REMEDIATION.md §5 Item 3 (of 4); depends on Task 223 (Item 2 landed 2026-09-29 commit 31b648098). Sequencing: Item 4 (Task 225 — retire model1-*.bicep + associated code paths) follows T224.</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Cross-cutting rename touching TenancyModel enum + ~7 handler branch sites (H1/H2b/H12c/H13/ArmCostEnvelopeChecker/AiSearchTenantFilterInvariantProbe/RunsEndpoints via KnownTenancyModels) + ~37 test-fixture `nameof()` sites (H3EntraAppRegHandlerTests + A42FicReconciliationTests + H12cRuntimeReferencesHandlerTests + ArmCostEnvelopeCheckerTests + AiSearchTenantFilterInvariantProbeTests + H1SubscriptionReadinessHandlerTests + TenancyModelParserTests) + ~11 inline comment references + Dataverse option-set labels + Extend-DataverseEnvironmentSchema-v3.3.ps1 script; tags include `auth`+`provisioning`+`dataverse`+`testing`; modifies `tests/**` (root CLAUDE.md §8 test-modifying unconditional-FULL override).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Fully-specified mechanical rename; low ambiguity; minimal design decisions (all resolved via owner AskUserQuestion at task filing time — see &lt;owner-decisions&gt; below). Sonnet @ high is correct; xhigh reserved for the complex-but-fully-specified brownfield-migration bucket, and T224 is simpler than T223 (T223 introduced the enum + parser; T224 renames its members).</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
